# Leia's CNSDK, used only by the leia-panel flavours (leiaLumepad, leiaRedmagic). Licensed to
# Leia's partners rather than published, so it is supplied locally and must never be
# committed or redistributed -- see app/libs/README.md. The .so files are already
# covered by the jniLibs rule above.
